 $('#strict-worked-example').innerHTML=`<h3>Worked example: 1 ETH, with Liquid’s RLUSD loan terms</h3><p>Annual illustration: observed loan terms, a separately dated investment quote, fixed ETH/USD and full investment of borrowed dollars.</p><div class="tblwrap">${stTable(['Step','Per 1 ETH of equity'],[['Deposit','1.0000 ETH','Investor equity'],['Keep staking collateral',num(v.collateral_share,4)+' ETH','Staking baseline '+pct(baseline,2)+' a year'],['Borrow RLUSD',num(borrowed,4)+' ETH equivalent','Borrowed dollars / collateral: '+pct(v.ltv,2)],['Earn on the borrowed dollars','+'+num(investment,6)+' ETH equivalent',pct(v.parking_rate,2)+' investment APY, including rewards'],['Pay the dollar loan','−'+num(cost,6)+' ETH equivalent',pct(v.borrow_rate,2)+' annual funding equivalent'],['Add staking income','+'+num(baseline,6)+' ETH','Income on the modeled equity'],['Pay the product fee','−'+num(v.operator_fee,6)+' ETH',pct(v.operator_fee,2)+' annual NAV fee'],['Keep, including rewards',num(pr.net_ETH_income,6)+' ETH / '+pct(pr.net_ETH_income,2),'Total modeled annual income'],['Keep, without rewards',num(pr.no_reward_ETH_income,6)+' ETH / '+pct(pr.no_reward_ETH_income,2),'Base investment income, loan cost, staking and fee']].map(r=>r.slice(0,2)))}</div><p class="note">Without rewards, dollar carry contributes ${num(pr.no_reward_carry_uplift_before_outer_fee*100,2)} percentage points before the product fee. Staking keeps the total positive. This is modeled income; historical product profit is separate.</p><details class="more"><summary>Observed accounts, loan balances and the quote behind the example</summary><div class="body"><p>The two examined accounts hold ${num(worked.measured_leg.collateral_weETH,2)} weETH and owe ${num(worked.measured_leg.estimated_accrued_RLUSD_debt,0)} RLUSD after projecting interest to T. The destination claim is a separate observation; its balance alone does not trace the source of its funding.</p><div class="tblwrap">${stTable(['Observation','Value','Basis','Status'],worked.ledger.map(r=>[esc(r.step),r.unit.includes('fraction')||r.unit.includes('income /')?pct(r.value,4):num(r.value,2)+' '+esc(r.unit),esc(stYieldCopy(r.evidence)),esc(r.status)]))}</div><a href="library/CARRY-MATH.html">Full calculation and source evidence →</a></div></details>`;
